  actionManager: {fileID: 0}
  idNumber: 10
  unitName: Oil Generator
  unitNameKey: aug_oil_nme
  unitDesc:
  - A non-renewable generator that uses oil to generate energy, which can only be
    used on oil source spots. It also produces high amounts of air pollution.
  - If an oil generator is destroyed by an enemy before it's finished generating
    energy, it will leave an oil spill. No units can be placed on a tile that has
    an oil spill.
  - This generator produces a very high amount of energy at a moderate rate.
  unitDescKey: aug_oil_dsc
